            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The cheapest supplier is slow and unreliable. On a package that is about to run dry, that costs far more in idle wages than it saves."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "El proveedor más barato es lento y poco confiable. En una partida a punto de quedarse sin material, eso cuesta mucho más en sueldos parados de lo que ahorra."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The client pays in lumps as you hit milestones, and always behind the work — so you finance the next stretch yourself.": {
