    "The previous session ended without reaching the background and without a crash signal. This usually means the system terminated the app for using too much memory, or it stopped responding.": {
      "comment": "Diagnostic detail",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The previous session ended without reaching the background and without a crash signal. This usually means the system terminated the app for using too much memory, or it stopped responding."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La sesión anterior terminó sin pasar a segundo plano y sin señal de cierre inesperado. Normalmente significa que el sistema cerró la app por usar demasiada memoria, o que dejó de responder."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The problem is clinical trust. Certification sits on the critical path and no amount of engineering moves it.": {
      "comment": "Discovery finding",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The problem is clinical trust. Certification sits on the critical path and no amount of engineering moves it."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "El problema es la confianza clínica. La certificación está en la ruta crítica y ninguna cantidad de ingeniería la mueve."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The problem is developer time. Adoption will be slow and retention will be excellent, if the thing is genuinely good.": {
      "comment": "Discovery finding",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The problem is developer time. Adoption will be slow and retention will be excellent, if the thing is genuinely good."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "El problema es el tiempo del desarrollador. La adopción será lenta y la retención excelente, si la herramienta es realmente buena."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The problem is inference cost. You are building infrastructure, and the people who matter are the ones who can measure it.": {
      "comment": "Discovery finding",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The problem is inference cost. You are building infrastructure, and the people who matter are the ones who can measure it."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "El problema es el costo de inferencia. Estás construyendo infraestructura, y la gente que importa es la que sabe medirlo."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The problem is liquidity, not product. You are building a market, and it lives or dies on how cheaply you can bring people to it.": {
      "comment": "Discovery finding",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The problem is liquidity, not product. You are building a market, and it lives or dies on how cheaply you can bring people to it."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "El problema es la liquidez, no el producto. Estás construyendo un mercado, y vive o muere según qué tan barato traigas gente."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The problem is moving money safely. Nothing ships until it is compliant, and that changes who you need.": {
      "comment": "Discovery finding",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The problem is moving money safely. Nothing ships until it is compliant, and that changes who you need."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "El problema es mover dinero de forma segura. Nada sale hasta que cumple, y eso cambia a quién necesitas."
          }
        }
      }
    },
